   496	  MIXED    no multiset of profiles with sum a_1 <= ue and sum a_1 c integral in
   497	           [N_min,N_max]     (UNCONDITIONAL given THEOREM EXACT-N)
   498	```
   499	MIXED is a bounded knapsack (exact integer arithmetic after clearing one common
   500	denominator per group) with early exit and a 20 000-state cap; cap hits are counted
   501	**UNDECIDED, never killed**, so every MIXED number is a lower bound. Caps 20 000
   502	and 200 000 give the identical count at `D <= 70` (131).
